        "DisplayName": "Public Address",
        "Category": "Star Conflict:rocket_launch",
        "Subcategory": "Network:lan:1",
        "Description": "IP address players use to reach this server. It is written as the node address in cloud/data/cloud.xml, which the load balancer hands to clients for the shard, chat and battle servers. Empty = use the application IP binding, or if that is 0.0.0.0 the instance IP binding (Webserver.IPBinding), or 127.0.0.1 if neither is set. Must be an IP of one of the host's own network interfaces (for example a NetBird/Tailscale/LAN IP): Hub finds its own node by checking its interfaces, so a DNS name or NAT-forwarded public IP stops Hub from starting. Set 127.0.0.1 for the game's original same-machine-only value.",
